      "content": "That feeling of things being slightly out of sync can be unsettling, and sometimes our brains can play tricks on us when we're feeling stressed or tired. Coincidences happen all the time, but it's natural to start looking for patterns when those little oddities pile up. It sounds like you're experiencing a low-grade sense of cognitive unease, which is a surprisingly common human experience.",
